  /**
   * Set a prefix for environment variables used to supply option values.
   *
   * After calling this, every option of the command which does not have its own
   * environment variable set using `.env()` reads its value from an environment
   * variable named the prefix followed by the option name in UPPER_SNAKE_CASE.
   * This applies to options added before or after the call.
